@strong{@anchor{Exercise 2.40}Exercise 2.40:} Define a procedure
@code{unique-pairs} that, given an integer @math{n}, generates the sequence of
pairs @math{{(i, j)}} with @math{{1 \le j} < {i \le n}}.  Use @code{unique-pairs}
to simplify the definition of @code{prime-sum-pairs} given above.
@end quotation

