|             |             |    | up-  | up-  |             |
|             | right-split |    | split| split| corner-split|
|             |             |    |      |      |             |
|             |     n-1     |    |  n-1 |  n-1 |     n-1     |
|             |             |    |      |      |             |
|  identity   +-------------+    +------+------+-------------+
|             |             |    |             | right-split |
|             | right-split |    |             |     n-1     |
|             |             |    |  identity   +-------------+
|             |     n-1     |    |             | right-split |
|             |             |    |             |     n-1     |
+-------------+-------------+    +-------------+-------------+

       right-split n                    corner-split n
